      "sample_index": 3,
      "text": "To determine the day of the week for December 23 given that Thanksgiving is on Thursday, November 23, we can follow these steps:\n\n1. Calculate the number of days between November 23 and December 23.\n2. Determine the day of the week for December 23 based on the number of days within the month and the starting day of November.\n\nFirst, let's find the number of days between November 23 and December 23:\n\\[ \\text{Days} = (30 - 23) + 1 = 8 \\text{ days} \\]\n\nNext, we need to determine the day of the week for December 23. Since November 23 is a Thursday, we can count 8 days forward from Thursday:\n\\[ \\text{Thursday} + 7 \\text{ days} = \\text{Monday} \\]\n\\[ \\text{Monday} + 1 \\text{ day} = \\text{Tuesday} \\]\n\\[ \\text{Tuesday} + 1 \\text{ day} = \\text{Wednesday} \\]\n\\[ \\text{Wednesday} + 1 \\text{ day} = \\text{Thursday} \\]\n\\[ \\text{Thursday} + 1 \\text{ day} = \\text{Friday} \\]\n\\[ \\text{Friday} + 1 \\text{ day} = \\text{Saturday} \\]\n\\[ \\text{Saturday} + 1 \\text{ day} = \\text{Sunday} \\]\n\\[ \\text{Sunday} + 1 \\text{ day} = \\text{Monday} \\]\n\nTherefore, December 23 falls on a \\boxed{\\text{Monday}}.",
